Subject: [PATCH 19/78] PlaitOS: adapt notification kill button to GrapheneOS

Read the switch from a plain Settings.System key, plait_notification_kill_app_button
(default off, written by Plait Settings), instead of a new Settings API
constant; drop the unused CentralSurfaces and PackageInfo imports.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
